Datasets and classification tasks. We used nine publicly available benchmark datasets covering five protein function prediction tasks. (1) DNA-binding proteins: PDB1075 (525 positive/550 negative; jackknife cross-validation) and PDB186 (93/93; independent test). (2) Bacteriophage virion proteins: Meta-iPVP_TR (250/250; 10-fold cross-validation) and Meta-iPVP_TS (63/63; independent test). (3) Anti-CRISPR proteins: PaCRISPR_TRN (98/902; 5-fold cross-validation) and PaCRISPR_IND (26/260; independent test). (4) Human phosphoproteins: PhosP (1132/638; jackknife and 10-fold cross-validation). (5) Subcellular localization: ZW225 (4 classes, 225 apoptosis proteins; jackknife) and CL317 (6 classes, 317 apoptosis proteins; jackknife). For the multi-class datasets, ZW225 comprises nucleus, cytoplasm, membrane, and mitochondria; CL317 comprises cytoplasm, membrane, mitochondria, secretory, nucleus, and endoplasmic reticulum. All binary classification datasets were redundancy-filtered using CD-HIT at the following identity thresholds: 25% for PDB1075/PDB186, 40% for Meta-iPVP, 70%/40% for PaCRISPR positives/negatives, and 50% for PhosP. Following the original dataset construction protocols, short sequences (<50 amino acids) and sequences containing ambiguous residues (e.g., X, B, U, Z) were excluded. No new data were generated in this study. Dataset splits, sequence counts, and evaluation protocols follow the original publications and are summarized in Supplementary Table 1.


数据集与分类任务。 本研究使用了九个公开基准数据集，涵盖五类蛋白质功能预测任务。（1）DNA 结合蛋白：PDB1075（525 个正样本/550 个负样本；刀切法交叉验证）和 PDB186（93/93；独立测试）。（2）噬菌体病毒颗粒蛋白：Meta-iPVP_TR（250/250；10 折交叉验证）和 Meta-iPVP_TS（63/63；独立测试）。（3）抗 CRISPR 蛋白：PaCRISPR_TRN（98/902；5 折交叉验证）和 PaCRISPR_IND（26/260；独立测试）。（4）人类磷酸化蛋白：PhosP（1132/638；刀切法和 10 折交叉验证）。（5）亚细胞定位：ZW225（4 类，225 条凋亡蛋白；刀切法）和 CL317（6 类，317 条凋亡蛋白；刀切法）。对于多分类数据集，ZW225 包括细胞核、细胞质、细胞膜和线粒体；CL317 包括细胞质、细胞膜、线粒体、分泌型、细胞核和内质网。所有二分类数据集均使用 CD-HIT 进行冗余过滤，身份阈值如下：PDB1075/PDB186 为 25%，Meta-iPVP 为 40%，PaCRISPR 阳性/阴性为 70%/40%，PhosP 为 50%。遵循原始数据集构建方案，短序列（少于 50 个氨基酸）以及包含模糊残基（如 X、B、U、Z）的序列已被剔除。本研究未生成新数据。数据集划分、序列数量及评估方案均遵循原始文献，并总结于补充表 1。
